00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
erase trauma, what it does is open a door that silence has sealed shut for years, this

2
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,480
is what breaking stigma looks like at the level, most of us actually operate it, not current

3
00:00:05,480 --> 00:00:11,320
gestures, normalized conversations, checking in and meaning it, listening without pivoting

4
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:16,360
